offensive.text:
The jann calls upon all of the elements that make up their being to gain an additional arcane spell they can cast at will and empower their Strikes with the element, dealing an extra 1d4 damage of the listed type. These benefits last until the jann uses this ability again.

Air [Tailwind](/spell/tailwind-player-core), 1d4 electricity;
Earth [Pummeling Rubble](/spell/pummeling-rubble-player-core), 1d4 bludgeoning;
Fire [Breathe Fire](/spell/breathe-fire-player-core), 1d4 fire;
Metal [Thunderstrike](/spell/thunderstrike-player-core), 1d4 electricity;
Water [Hydraulic Push](/spell/hydraulic-push-player-core), 1d4 bludgeoning;
Wood [Summon Plant Or Fungus](/spell/summon-plant-or-fungus-player-core), 1d4 piercing.

